{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, grab it, check properties, drop at destination or move to destination. Otherwise scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    />     <Action ID = DropObject    /> </Sequence> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />\"",
